flowchart LR
  Browser --> HTTP[Express HTTP adapter]
  HTTP --> Auth[Session + CSRF + RBAC + account lifecycle]
  HTTP --> Service[Appointment service]
  Service --> SQLite[(SQLite WAL)]
  SQLite --> Outbox[Transactional outbox]
  Outbox --> Worker[Retryable notification worker]
  HTTP --> Ops[Admin queue operations + audited redrive]
  SQLite --> Backup[Online backup + staged restore]
  Ops --> SQLite
  Backup --> SQLite
  HTTP --> Health[Health + metrics]
